stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Observing: Native fault produces immutable plan
    Observing --> Rejected: Scope / stale / availability / budget / conflict denied
    Observing --> DryRun: Global or policy execution disabled
    Observing --> Escalated: Alert-only action or no safe revision
    Observing --> AwaitingApproval: Risk requires signed exact plan
    AwaitingApproval --> Rejected: Expiry / policy / workload changed
    AwaitingApproval --> Applying: Valid signature and fresh safety checks
    Observing --> Applying: Explicitly permitted low-risk restart
    Applying --> Verifying: Persist intent then guarded API patch
    Applying --> Failed: Ambiguous result places safety hold
    Verifying --> Succeeded: Repeated rollout / replicas / SLI checks pass
    Verifying --> RollingBack: Verification fails with signed undo consent
    Verifying --> Escalated: Verification fails without safe authorized undo
    RollingBack --> VerifyingRollback: Persist second intent then guarded patch
    RollingBack --> Failed: Ambiguous result places safety hold
    VerifyingRollback --> RolledBack: Undo independently verified
    VerifyingRollback --> Escalated: Undo verification fails / safety hold
    Succeeded --> [*]
    DryRun --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
    RolledBack --> [*]
    Escalated --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
